  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When one of your allies primes a technique, you respond immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Knowledge of at least one technique.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When multiple characters with this feat work together to initiate a multi-character technique, the technique is performed on the highest of the participants’ initiative counts rather than the lowest. All participants have their actions for the turn moved up to the initiative count where the technique is performed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
